legend right
  |= Colour |= Role |
  |<#E3F2FD>        | controller (gRPC, Kafka, cron entry) |
  |<#FFF3E0>        | use case |
  |<#F3E5F5>        | command + handler |
  |<#E8F5E9>        | port / domain service |
  |<#F1F8E9>        | pure rule |
  |<#ECEFF1>        | request / response / presenter model |
  |<#FCE4EC>        | domain event |
  |<#FFEBEE>        | driven adapter (vendor SDK) |
  |<#E8EAF6>        | entity |
  Solid arrow = calls or uses. Dashed arrow = sends a command, publishes, or creates.
endlegend
